WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.910
Huh?

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:56.840
Yahoo!

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.880
A-are you all right?!

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.020
Yeah! It's okay, it's okay!

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:08.620
They're new recruits who heard
all about me and came from afar...

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:11.430
...to join the Usopp Pirates!

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:14.500
No, not me!

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.100
I'm here to ask a favor!

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.430
A favor? Of me?

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:20.230
Yeah! We want a big ship-

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.370
You, there!

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.030
What are you doing?!

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.500
Klahadore...

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:36.120
I don't appreciate you breaking
in here without permission!

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.300
Who's there?!

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:05.540
"The Weirdest Guy Ever!
Jango the Hypnotist"

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.850
A-actually, Klahadore,
these people are-

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.420
That can wait for now.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:18.090
I can hear all about
your reasons later.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:19.990
Now leave, all of you!

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.860
Or do you have
something to say?

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:25.500
Well, actually,
we want a ship!

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.830
No!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.670
<i>Usopp-kun!</i>

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:30.670
Crap!

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:33.340
I've heard all about you.

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:35.330
You're well-known
in the village.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.850
Yeah?

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.650
I hear you've been
on many an adventure.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.620
Quite impressive
for someone so young.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:45.990
You can call me
Captain Usopp, too!

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.120
Since you admire
me so much!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.110
Captain, huh...

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.030
I've heard all about
your father, as well.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.800
What?!

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:57.900
Klahadore! Stop!

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.970
You're nothing but the son
of a filthy pirate!

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:05.010
Nothing you do
will surprise me,

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.970
but I ask that you stay away
from the lady of this house!

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.810
F-filthy?!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.680
She and you are from
completely different worlds!

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.990
Is it money you're after?
How much do you want?

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:23.160
<i>That's enough, Klahadore!
Apologize to Usopp-san!</i>

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.960
Hey, now! Be careful, Kaya!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:30.160
What reason is there to apologize
to this savage man, my lady?

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:34.070
I am merely stating the truth.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.970
I feel for you.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:38.970
You must truly hate your great
idiot of a father...

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:43.240
...for abandoning his family and village
because of his lust for treasure!

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.250
Klahadore!

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.410
Don't you dare insult
my father any more!

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.080
<i>Usopp-san!</i>

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.060
What are you getting
unnecessarily riled up for?

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:05.800
Why not simply tell another of your
special lies at a time like this?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.600
About how your father is really
a traveling salesman,

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.310
or how you're not really
related by blood...

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.800
Shut up!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.090
--Captain!
--Captain!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:28.620
S-see! You immediately
resort to violence!

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:31.360
Like father, like son!

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.530
Shut up!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:37.100
I'm proud that my father
is a pirate!

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:40.630
I'm proud that he's a brave
warrior of the sea!

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:43.740
<i>You're right,
I am an exaggerator!</i>

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:49.080
<i>But I'll never lie about my pride
to be related by blood to a pirate!</i>

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.410
I'm the son of a pirate!

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:56.880
Captain...

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.190
A pirate,
a brave warrior of the sea?

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:05.320
That's quite a twisted way
of putting things...

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:10.500
<i>But you're the undeniable
proof of his savage blood!</i>

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.800
You run around spouting lies,

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.840
and act violent
whenever you're angry!

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:15.840
And to top it off,

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:18.610
you cozy up to the lady of this house
so you can get her fortune!

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.310
What?! I only-!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.710
The fact your father is a pirate...

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:26.280
...is more than enough proof that
you'd hatch such a scheme!

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:27.620
Damn it, you still won't let up?!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.420
<i>Stop, Usopp-san!</i>

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.750
Please, no more violence!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.990
Klahadore isn't a bad person!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.530
He's just...

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:43.860
He's just trying too hard
to do what's best for me!

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.440
Leave this place!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.100
Never come near
this mansion again!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.540
Yeah, I get it.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:07:00.070
I don't need you to tell me!

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.920
I'll never come back here again!

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:07.150
<i>Usopp-san...</i>

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.260
You stupid butt-ler jerk!

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.260
Our captain's not
that kind of guy!

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:14.730
Yeah! You stupid-head!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.930
Stupid-head!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:20.270
Why're you saying it too?!

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:24.640
--What's your problem?!
--Hey, now! Stop!

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.040
--Let go! You stupid butler!
--What?!

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.440
Come fight me, if you can!

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:34.940
You will leave at once, too!

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.770
Your meal, my lady.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:57.670
No thanks. I don't want it.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.910
The cook would be sad
to hear you say that.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:11.180
He works his hardest to come up
with meals that suit your needs.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:19.030
Why did you talk like that?

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:25.600
<i>I know I was wrong to talk with
Usopp-san without telling you.</i>

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:29.260
But you didn't need to kick him
out like that.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.380
May I sit?

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:38.210
Go ahead.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:47.350
It's been nearly three years...

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:51.460
...since the day
I came to this mansion.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:55.090
I'll never forget what
happened that day...

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:22.490
I was kicked off
the ship I worked on...

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:25.130
...because of
a blunder I made,

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:27.130
and with no work or money,

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:30.230
I was on the verge of dying
like a beggar.

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:32.000
Hey, you! Get out of here!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.330
Get up! This is no place for
the likes of you!

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:46.080
Huh?! Sir?! But...

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.820
Understood! Take him inside
and tend to him!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:10:01.630
In my eyes, I owe my life
to your late parents...

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:06.500
And to you, their daughter.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:15.980
I realize that it isn't my place
to interfere with your friendships.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:21.280
But that Usopp lad isn't exactly
known for his upstanding character!

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:25.890
If... if anything
should happen to you,

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:30.690
I would never be able to ask for
forgiveness from your kind parents!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.700
Do you think ill of me for
what I did earlier?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.030
No, not at all!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.830
I'm glad to have you too,
Klahadore!

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.370
But please don't misunderstand.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.970
<i>Usopp-san is a very nice person.</i>

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:48.140
However, whether he's nice
or not is irrelevant!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:51.480
Klahadore! Urgh!
You blockhead!

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.640
Yes, "blockhead"
will do just fine!

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.730
Hey, where'd Luffy go?

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:16.840
Who knows. Probably ran
after that "captain".

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:18.510
Our captain would
be at his spot!

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.170
Yeah, the shore!

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:23.010
He always goes there
when something happens!

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:26.010
Wanna check it out?

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:28.520
Huh? Nah, that's okay.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:31.690
But never mind that,
isn't one of you missing?

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.550
--Yeah, Onion!
--Yeah, Onion!

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:36.390
He always just ups and disappears!

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:39.720
Yeah! And then he shows up
all freaked out!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.360
Bad news!

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:44.360
See?

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:47.400
A b-backwards guy!

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:49.970
A weird guy is backwards-walking
this way!

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.140
--Liar!
--Liar!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:53.010
It's the truth!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.500
Just look!

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:06.850
Hey! Who's calling
me a weird guy?!

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:12.590
<i>I am not weird!</i>

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:14.630
Seem pretty weird to me.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:15.960
Don't be stupid!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.700
I'm just an ordinary,
passing-by hypnotist!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:21.300
H-hypnotist?! Awesome!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.840
Show us something!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.940
Yeah! Do something!

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:26.000
What?!

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.210
Don't be dumb!

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:31.180
Why should I have to reveal...

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:34.550
...my techniques
to a bunch of strangers?!

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.880
Alright. Watch this ring closely.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.290
You're gonna do it?!

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.660
You'll feel sleepy at the count of
"one, two, Jango".

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.860
Alright, here we go!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.160
One, two,

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.150
Jango!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.930
Geez, what's with this guy?!

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:05.080
Yo!

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.310
Here you are!

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:09.820
Oh, it's just you!
At least say something, will ya?!

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.950
So, what, do you want something?!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.280
Not really.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:21.890
Oww...

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.000
That damn butler,

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.110
insulting my old man like that!

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:34.610
Yeah, I hate that guy too!

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:38.050
No matter what anyone says,
Yasopp was a great pirate!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.880
Yeah, huh?!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:43.180
In this day and age
where pirates are everywhere,

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:47.150
I'm proud of my old man for living
with his life on the line at sea!

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:50.860
Yet, that bastard stomped
all over my pride!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.660
He'll pay for this!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:56.860
But you're not gonna go see
the girl anymore?

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:59.700
Y-yeah, I dunno...

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:03.740
If that butler comes and apologizes
to me, I might consider it.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.470
<i>That butler?</i>

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:07.540
Yeah, that butler...

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.180
What's that butler
doing out here?!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.850
Oww! That hurts!

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.180
Hey, Jango.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:17.650
I told you to avoid doing
anything to make you stand out.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:20.120
Yet you go and sleep in the
middle of the village...

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.460
Don't be stupid.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:25.060
I don't stand out one bit.
I'm not weird, either.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.660
There's someone else with him.
A weird guy...

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.530
Never seen him before.
Who is he?

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:34.840
So, preparations for the plan
are ready, I hope?

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:36.200
Of course.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:42.440
We can start anytime...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:45.110
The Rich Girl
Assassination Plan!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:51.650
A-assassination?!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:17.140
Don't call it assassination, Jango.
That has a bad ring to it.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:20.710
Oh, right. Accident.
It's an accident.

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:25.350
Hey, what're those
guys talking about?

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:29.860
<i>D-don't look at me!
That's what I'd like to know!</i>

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.430
We can't simply kill her.

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:36.300
Miss Kaya must perish
in an unfortunate accident.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:39.070
Don't mess that up!

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:40.900
So basically, on your signal,

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:45.240
the men and I storm
the village and kill the girl.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:48.540
And then you'll get
her inheritance...

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:51.450
You fool!
You don't understand a thing!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:54.980
How would I, an outsider,
inherit Kaya's estate?!

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:56.950
You'll work hard to?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:59.520
Working hard won't
amount to squat.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.490
Listen, this is
the most important thing!

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.820
<i>Before you kill her,</i>

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:07.060
you'll use hypnosis to make
Kaya write her will...

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:11.400
...to say, "I leave my entire
fortune to my butler, Klahadore!"

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:19.140
Only then will I inherit
her enormous fortune...

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:22.710
In a completely ordinary manner...

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:27.650
I've spent three long years gaining
the trust of everyone around me...

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:32.350
...so that it would be unsurprising for
her to leave her inheritance to me.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:35.690
Three years as a butler
for that, huh...

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:38.160
But you sure
scared us back then...

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:40.260
Captain Kuro.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:44.830
Three years ago, you suddenly said
you were giving up life as a pirate.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.970
In no time flat, you set up
a subordinate to be your double,

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:51.700
then let the world see
Captain Kuro get executed.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:06.190
<i>So that was the very beginning
of this plan.</i>

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:08.490
You truly are Kuro,
Man of a Thousand Plans.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.560
Don't call me that.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.990
I abandoned that name
three years ago.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:15.400
I now want to obtain great
sums of money...

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.760
...without the government
on my back.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.760
In other words,
I'm a pacifist.

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:24.500
Some pacifist you are,

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:29.410
killing off an entire rich
family for this "peace" of yours.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:32.710
Hold on, now.
The father's death was real.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.710
I hadn't planned on that.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:37.250
Well, whatever.
It doesn't matter.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:39.890
Anyways, hurry
and give the signal.

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:45.490
We've been sitting in the waters
near here for a whole week now.

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:48.590
The men are starting
to grow impatient.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:18:00.000
<i>This is bad!
We heard something really bad!</i>

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:03.940
Hey, what's going on?
This sounds kind of bad.

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:07.580
<i>Weren't you listening this whole time?!
This is seriously bad!</i>

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.280
They're the real deal!

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:16.860
Captain Kuro is said to be the smartest
and most brutal pirate of all!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:21.160
Word had it the navy caught
and executed him three years ago...

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.460
...but Captain Kuro is alive!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:26.130
As Klahadore, the butler!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:32.130
He's been after Kaya's fortune
for these past three years straight!

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:38.140
They're gonna attack the village!

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.810
Kaya's in danger, too!

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.620
Bad! This is seriously bad!

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.290
Hey! Don't stand up!
They'll see you!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:00.630
Hey, you guys!
Don't attack that girl!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.740
Who're you?!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:06.370
You idiot!
They spotted you!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.780
Hurry and hide before
they kill you!

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:10.010
Oh...

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:14.010
<i>If it isn't Usopp-kun.</i>

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:16.450
They spotted me, too!

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:19.750
Did you... hear anything?

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:22.490
N-no! Whatever do you mean?!

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:25.360
We just got here now, so of
course we didn't hear anything!

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.390
We heard everything!

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:27.660
Hey, you!

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:37.670
Oh, all right.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:42.480
Hey, you guys!
Watch this ring closely!

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.980
What?

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:47.510
T-this is bad!
It's a throwing weapon! Dodge it!

00:19:47.510 --> 00:19:50.850
At the count of "one, two, Jango"
you will get sleepy.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:52.520
Ready?

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:55.290
--One, two...
--Hide! He's gonna kill us!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.620
...Jango!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.000
Hey! Wake up, Jango!

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.330
Have you still not fixed
that habit yet?!

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:10.000
H-hey! What're you doing?!
You're gonna fall!

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.210
Head-first...

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:19.910
<i>I didn't mean to kill him,</i>

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:22.680
but he couldn't have survived
from that height...

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:26.450
Damn it!
He killed him!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.090
That bastard!
Damn it!

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:32.430
What about the other one?
Shall I take care of him?

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.030
No need.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:37.190
No matter what he does,
it won't matter.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:43.800
Tomorrow morning, Jango.
Attack the village at daybreak.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.010
Tear up the villagers' homes
a good amount,

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:50.500
and make certain Miss Kaya's
murder looks like an accident!

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.180
Tomorrow!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:55.580
<i>You heard me, Usopp-kun.</i>

00:20:55.580 --> 00:21:00.390
There's nothing you can do
to stop my plan.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:02.050
Damn it!

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.130
You sure about him?

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:10.760
Of course.
My plans are flawless.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.670
<i>This is bad,
this is bad, this is bad!</i>

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:18.640
<i>Everyone in this village
I grew up in is going to be killed!</i>

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:21.010
<i>Kaya's going to be killed!</i>

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:24.210
<i>Even though I love them all!</i>

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:38.790
Who are you?!

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:43.360
I'm Usopp!
A brave warrior of the sea!

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:45.530
I hear you've been unhappy lately!

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:48.030
I'll cheer you up with a story!

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:50.070
Mind your own business!

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.870
Please leave!
I'll call for someone!

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:58.650
And then?
What happened after that?!

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:01.480
I fought, of course!
Bravely, at that!

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.610
First, for the giant cat,
I used a cattail plant...

00:22:11.690 --> 00:22:16.190
Damn it!

00:22:56.040 --> 00:23:06.030
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
